Execution
Guidance,Details
Harness Entry Function,test_case() must be invoked by the platform test harness.
IRQ Prerequisites,Enable GIC IRQs 80 and 81; ensure Default_IRQHandler clears I2C0 transfer-complete interrupt and LSS sysreg raw status.
DMA Prerequisites,PDMA configured: channels 0 (TX to I2C0) and 1 (RX from I2C1) as used in sources; wait for DMA disable loop to finish.
I2C Configuration,Program I2C0/1 DEV_CTRL, BYTE_CNT, thresholds; High-speed test sets HS counters; Standard-mode sets SF counters; mask interrupts appropriately; set target/slave addresses as in sources.
Platform Setup,Make LSS NIC non-secure on specified 0xA1700008..0xA1700054 registers before test.

